<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1862593100"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1615751512"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Lapis"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="TrySail"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TVアニメ「マギアレコード 魔法少女まどか☆マギカ外伝 2nd SEASON -覚醒前夜-」Theme Song Collection"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:56.146"><div begin="00:14.801" end="03:40.931"><p begin="00:14.801" end="00:18.652" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43669">手を滑らせ沈んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从手中滑落沉没的谎言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te wo su be ra se shi zu n da</span></p><p begin="00:18.662" end="00:24.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43670">嘘は まだそこに浮かんで消えない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依旧浮现眼前消失不去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u so wa ma da so ko ni u ka n de ki e na i</span></p><p begin="00:24.764" end="00:28.728" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43671">見上げた空は濁って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仰望的天空浑浊不堪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi a ge ta so ra wa ni go 't te</span></p><p begin="00:28.730" end="00:34.738" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43672">何がホント？ 言って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我什么才是真实</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni ga ho n to ? i 't te</span></p><p begin="00:34.748" end="00:38.697" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43673">深く深く底向かって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着深不可见的渊底</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ka ku fu ka ku so ko mu ka 't te</span></p><p begin="00:39.140" end="00:44.701" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43674">願い事探し夢潜ったまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了找寻心愿而深潜进梦境中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne ga i go to sa ga shi yu me mo gu 't ta ma ma</span></p><p begin="00:44.711" end="00:52.575" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43675">巻き上がる泥の中を抜けもっと早く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从飞扬而起的泥沼中穿行而过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ki a ga ru do ro no na ka wo nu ke</span></p><p begin="00:54.644" end="00:59.365" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43676">温かさだけ保ち逆さの太陽目指し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">维持着微末的温热 追寻着那颠倒的太阳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ta ka sa da ke ta mo chi sa ka sa no ta i yo u me za shi</span></p><p begin="00:59.626" end="01:04.355" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43677">なくした君の今、会いに行こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在失去了你的此刻 让我前去与你相会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ku shi ta ki mi no i ma a i ni i ko u</span></p><p begin="01:04.365" end="01:09.507" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43678">離したら静かで思い出が騒がしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">分离之际平静如水 回忆却充满喧嚣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na shi ta ra shi zu ka de o mo i de ga sa wa ga shi i</span></p><p begin="01:09.795" end="01:11.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43679">意味のない言葉がいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕是无意义的话语也已经足够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i mi no na i ko to ba ga i i</span></p><p begin="01:11.990" end="01:19.828" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43680">見慣れた世界の奥で溺れよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此沉浸于司空见惯的世界深处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi na re ta se ka i no o ku de o bo re yo u</span></p><p begin="01:29.338" end="01:34.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43681">削られずに変わらない姿<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">维持着一成不变的身影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke zu ra re zu ni ka wa ra na i su ga ta</span></p><p begin="01:34.390" end="01:38.797" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43682">すぐ見つけてもらえるよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只愿能够立刻被你找到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su gu mi tsu ke te mo ra e ru yo u</span></p><p begin="01:39.449" end="01:44.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43683">胸の内に患った光で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在深入心底的光芒之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ne no u chi ni wa zu ra 't ta hi ka ri de</span></p><p begin="01:44.138" end="01:48.914" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43684">そっと 渇く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍在悄然地渴望着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so 't to ka wa ku</span></p><p begin="01:49.194" end="01:53.093" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43685">固く固く誓い立て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">立下坚定不移的誓言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ta ku ka ta ku chi ka i ta te</span></p><p begin="01:53.600" end="01:58.726" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43686">優しい声のまま君迎えに行く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用温柔的声音 迎接你的回归</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi i ko e no ma ma ki mi mu ka e ni i ku</span></p><p begin="01:59.291" end="02:05.363" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43687">重なれば崩れる程薄くなって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而一再的重复 却让忍耐削薄到快要崩溃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka sa na re ba ku zu re ru ho do u su ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="02:09.109" end="02:14.108" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43688">やわらいだ流れから輝いた影を救い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从柔和的水流之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya wa ra i da na ga re ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:14.118" end="02:18.959" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43689">生のない模造でも愛していたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便只是无生命的仿制品也想要去爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se i no na i mo zo u de mo a i shi te i ta i</span></p><p begin="02:18.969" end="02:24.254" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43690">正しさを失くしても守れない結末を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不惜抛弃正义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da shi sa wo na ku shi te mo</span></p><p begin="02:24.264" end="02:29.304" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43691">受け入れずに黙って蓋して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便无法接受 也会沉默着将其封存</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ke i re zu ni da ma 't te fu ta shi te</span></p><p begin="02:29.314" end="02:34.238" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43692">君の声をとどめよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至少想要把你的声音留下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ko e wo to do me yo u</span></p><p begin="02:35.557" end="02:39.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43693">すれ違う希望の群れとは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与擦肩而过的希望的群体</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su re chi ga u ki bo u no mu re to wa</span></p><p begin="02:39.400" end="02:44.788" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43694">反対に沈んで 身を任して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉入相反的方向 放任自己委身其中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha n ta i ni shi zu n de mi wo ma ka shi te</span></p><p begin="02:45.675" end="02:49.513" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43695">息さえも忘れ綺麗に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连呼吸也遗忘 彻底地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki sa e mo wa su re ki re i ni</span></p><p begin="02:49.523" end="02:51.851" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43696">ただ真っすぐに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">率直地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da ma 's su gu ni</span></p><p begin="02:52.032" end="02:54.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43697">ただ純粋に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纯粹地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da ju n su i ni</span></p><p begin="02:54.583" end="02:59.935" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43698">ただ君のため 落ちてみよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为了你 堕入深渊吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da ki mi no ta me o chi te mi yo u</span></p><p begin="03:02.134" end="03:04.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43699">冷たさが広がり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寒冷逐渐蔓延</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu me ta sa ga hi ro ga ri</span></p><p begin="03:04.720" end="03:07.188" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43700">音も全部なくなり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">声音也全部消失不见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to mo ze n bu na ku na ri</span></p><p begin="03:07.198" end="03:09.929" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43701">目の前さえもわからない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连眼前也分辨不清</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me no ma e sa e mo wa ka ra na i</span></p><p begin="03:12.280" end="03:17.301" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43702">温かさだけ保ち逆さの太陽目指し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">维持着微末的温热 追寻着那颠倒的太阳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ta ka sa da ke ta mo chi sa ka sa no ta i yo u me za shi</span></p><p begin="03:17.311" end="03:22.103" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43703">なくした君の今、会いに行こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在失去了你的此刻 让我前去与你相会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ku shi ta ki mi no i ma a i ni i ko u</span></p><p begin="03:22.113" end="03:27.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43704">離したら静かで思い出が騒がしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">分离之际平静如水 回忆却充满喧嚣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na shi ta ra shi zu ka de o mo i de ga sa wa ga shi i</span></p><p begin="03:27.430" end="03:29.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43705">意味のない言葉がいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕是无意义的话语也已经足够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i mi no na i ko to ba ga i i</span></p><p begin="03:29.669" end="03:34.999" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43706">見慣れた世界の奥で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于司空见惯的世界深处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi na re ta se ka i no o ku de</span></p><p begin="03:35.009" end="03:40.931" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43707">帰るように溺れよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同归家般沉溺其中吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka e ru yo u ni o bo re yo u</span></p></div></body></tt>